abstract: >
  Core data analytics project covering descriptive statistics, data structures,
  data ingestion, and exploratory analysis using Python source files.
  Structured datasets (CSV, JSON, Excel) and text data are used to implement
  modular analytic logic, apply relational data concepts,
  and introduce time series and predictive techniques
  within a professional, reproducible project workflow.

